    "synthesis": "Core Insight: Independent agents can achieve significant improvements in task completion time through implicit coordination when they share a common representation of their task graph. This emergent behavior suggests that decentralized, autonomous systems can exhibit coordinated behavior without explicit communication or centralized control. Remembered insight: Shared representations can act as an implicit communication channel, enabling decentralized agents to optimize performance and complete tasks more efficiently.",
